# Shared dotenv-linter policy for the Abugida monorepo (canonical reference).
#
# dotenv-linter 3.x discovers this file only via CWD-walk-up, so the root
# `lint:env` script passes the same skips as explicit flags. Keep both in
# sync — this file is the documented source of truth.
#
# - KeyShouldBeFormatted: the template groups keys with section headers and
#   comments; strict key formatting is not enforced across sections.
# - QuoteCharacterMismatch: the template carries quoted multi-word defaults
#   (e.g. OTEL resource attributes) alongside unquoted values.
# - UnorderedKey: keys are intentionally grouped by functional section
#   (identity, domains, ports, services), not alphabetically.
disable:
  - KeyShouldBeFormatted
  - QuoteCharacterMismatch
  - UnorderedKey
